# ⚡ NeuroWeb — AI Website Builder

NeuroWeb is an **AI-powered website generator** built with **React**, **Three.js**, and **React Three Fiber**.  
It allows users to input a prompt (e.g., “Build me a portfolio website”) and generates full HTML website code in real-time with beautiful **3D loaders** and **live previews**.

---

## 🌐 Live Demo
👉 [Coming Soon on Render](https://web-maker-at32.onrender.com)

---

## 🚀 Features

- 🧠 **AI Integration** — Connects with your backend AI API to generate websites from text prompts.
- 💻 **Live Code Editor** — Edit generated code directly inside the app using `react-simple-code-editor`.
- 🌈 **Real-Time Preview** — Instantly preview the generated HTML website.
- 🎨 **3D Animated Loaders** — Built using `Three.js` and `@react-three/fiber`.
- 🌙 **Dark / Light Mode Toggle**.
- 📋 **Copy & Download Options** for generated code.
- ⚡ **Responsive Design** with Tailwind CSS.

---

## 🧩 Tech Stack

| Frontend | Description |
|-----------|--------------|
| React | Core frontend framework |
| Tailwind CSS | Modern styling |
| Three.js + React Three Fiber | 3D visual effects and loaders |
| Axios | API communication |
| Prism.js | Syntax highlighting |
| react-simple-code-editor | Editable code area |

